id: pm-vwuidf
title: Refresh compatible 2026-08-29 dependency releases
description: "Adopt registry-current compatible greptile 3.4.2, @types/node 26.4.0, and @sentry/cli 3.7.0 releases while preserving the separately governed engine/tooling-incompatible npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 deferrals."
