acceptance_criteria: "package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml resolve greptile 3.4.2, @types/node 26.4.0, and @sentry/cli 3.7.0 exactly; pnpm outdated contains only npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 with their canonical evidence-backed deferrals; pnpm audit and GitHub dependency, code, and secret alert inventories remain zero; full exact coverage, static quality, packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx acceptance, hosted checks, and exact-head review pass"
