resolution: "Adopted compatible greptile 3.4.2, @types/node 26.4.0, and @sentry/cli 3.7.0 releases without changing the published Node compatibility range or the separately governed incompatible-major deferrals."
expected_result: "Compatible dependency patches resolve exactly, all source gates and packed npm/Bun acceptance pass, security inventories remain empty, and only evidence-backed incompatible majors remain outdated."
actual_result: "Resolved greptile 3.4.2, @types/node 26.4.0, and @sentry/cli 3.7.0; local coverage, build, static, security, and packed npm/Bun acceptance are green; hosted exact-head review remains pending; only pm-ksr40d and pm-do5b major deferrals remain."
